02:05:09,520 --> 02:05:18,240
and that requires much more exotic cooling. It requires more complicated cold plates and complex liquid cooling, or maybe even things like immersion cooling.

684
02:05:18,240 --> 02:05:25,760
In space, higher watts per millimeter is very difficult, whereas on Earth, these are solved problems. One of these things enables you to get a lot

685
02:05:25,760 --> 02:05:36,640
more tokens, maybe 20% more tokens per wafer that's manufactured, and that's a humongous win. Square millimeter, you mean of die area? Yeah, of die area.

686
02:05:36,640 --> 02:05:46,640
It would be better for space because more watts per millimeter means the chip runs hotter. I guess this is a question of computer chip engineering, but it cools to the

